{
    "_comments": [
        "Custom syntax highlighting theme for www.gregorykapfhammer.com",
        "Dark variant, designed for the site dark background #212121.",
        "Palette derives from the site theme (united-dark.scss / styles.css).",
        "Existing colors: deep orange #ef6c00 / #e65100 / #ff8a3d, blue",
        "#64b5f6, greys #bdbdbd, #9e9e9e, #212121, #333333.",
        "New accents (3): teal #4db6ac, purple #ce93d8, amber #ffca28.",
        "Schema: https://pandoc.org/MANUAL.html#syntax-highlighting"
    ],
    "metadata": {
        "name": "GMK Deep Orange Dark",
        "revision": 1
    },
